---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于我 | Echo's Blog" description="郭冰硕 (Echo) — Agent 研发工程师，好奇心驱动的技术探索者">
  <div class="py-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <header class="text-center mb-16">
      <div class="w-32 h-32 mx-auto mb-6 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-4 border-white dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xl">
        <img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100027799?v=4" alt="Echo's avatar" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">郭冰硕</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-medium mb-3">Echo</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6">Agent 研发工程师</p>

      <div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="https://github.com/bingshuoguo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-2 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-full text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors">
          <span class="sr-only">GitHub</span>
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:bingshuo.guo@gmail.com" class="p-2 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-full text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-blue-600 dark:hover:text-blue-400 hover:bg-blue-50 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/30 transition-colors">
          <span class="sr-only">Email</span>
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none prose-a:text-blue-600 dark:prose-a:text-blue-400">
      <h2>👋 你好</h2>
      <p>
        我是 Echo，一名 Agent 研发工程师。毕业于厦门大学，目前专注于 <strong>AI Agent 系统设计与开发</strong>、<strong>MCP 协议工具链</strong>以及<strong>智能体基础设施</strong>的建设。
      </p>
      <p>
        好奇心是引领整个冒险之旅的核心动力。我相信技术的价值在于解决真实问题，而开源是让好想法传播最快的方式。
      </p>

      <h2>💻 技术栈</h2>
      <ul class="not-prose grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-y-4 gap-x-6 list-none p-0 my-6">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 shrink-0"></span> Go</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 shrink-0"></span> Python</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 shrink-0"></span> C++</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 shrink-0"></span> AI Agent / MCP</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 shrink-0"></span> LLM 应用开发</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 shrink-0"></span> 分布式系统</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>✍️ 关于博客</h2>
      <p>
        这个博客既是我的技术笔记，也是思考分享。我会在这里写下关于：
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>AI Agent 系统的设计与实践：架构、协议、工具链。</li>
        <li>MCP 生态探索：构建连接 LLM 与外部世界的桥梁。</li>
        <li>后端工程实践：Go / Python / C++ 领域的经验与思考。</li>
        <li>工具与效率：打造趁手的开发工作流。</li>
      </ul>
      
      <div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
        <p class="m-0 italic text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-center">
          "好奇心是引领整个冒险之旅的核心动力。"
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
